WEBVTT

00:01.451 --> 00:12.093
[SPEAKER_01]: Early morning on the fifth of Whalesun, Owen and Folsom on the steerage deck of the small sloop with Tyrus down below, minding the sails.

00:13.273 --> 00:15.934
